<library>
<description>Secure Digital card connector Kingfont SDCMF-109XXW0X0

SDCMF-109aaW0b0
aa:
05 = 5u" gold plating
10 = 10u" gold plating
15 = 15u" gold plating

b:
1 = tin-lead 90/10
T = lead free</description>
